{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 21,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.21018981933594,
        502.1114196777344,
        83.29818725585938
      ],
      "text": "Moderate-complexity automated NAATs for detection of TB and resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        83.61033630371094,
        202.47369384765625,
        97.69833374023438
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin and isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.36524200439453,
        526.750244140625,
        121.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "The moderate-complexity automated NAATs (MC-aNAATs) are faster and less complex to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        123.86524200439453,
        527.1452026367188,
        137.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "perform than phenotypic culture-based DST and line probe assays (LPAs), and are largely",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.365234375,
        526.819091796875,
        152.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "automated after the sample preparation step. They may be used as an initial test for simultaneous",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        154.865234375,
        526.762451171875,
        168.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "detection of TB and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid. This type of NAAT offers the potential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95455551147461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.365234375,
        526.9688720703125,
        183.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "for rapid provision of accurate results and for testing efficiency where high volumes of tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.865234375,
        527.0250854492188,
        199.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "are required daily. Hence, they are suited to areas with a high population density and rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.365234375,
        187.79490661621094,
        214.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "sample referral systems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        226.8347930908203,
        518.1788330078125,
        243.27078247070312
      ],
      "text": "1.3.2 Initial tests for TB diagnosis without drug resistance detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.49131774902344,
        244.1893310546875,
        268.5793151855469
      ],
      "text": "Low-complexity manual NAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.2462158203125,
        526.8778686523438,
        292.3912353515625
      ],
      "text": "The low-complexity manual NAAT (LC-mNAAT), loop-mediated isothermal amplification",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.7462158203125,
        526.9644165039062,
        307.8912353515625
      ],
      "text": "(LAMP), is based on DNA amplification at a single temperature range; this contrasts with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.2462158203125,
        526.6202392578125,
        323.3912353515625
      ],
      "text": "polymerase chain reaction (PCR), which requires a thermocycler. Detection of amplified product",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955811500549316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.7462158203125,
        526.7225341796875,
        338.8912353515625
      ],
      "text": "is done visually, using an ultraviolet (UV) lamp, directly in the reaction tubes. The method",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.2462158203125,
        527.0193481445312,
        354.3912353515625
      ],
      "text": "requires only basic equipment and can be implemented at the lowest levels of the laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.7462158203125,
        527.2571411132812,
        369.8912353515625
      ],
      "text": "network. However, detection of mutations in resistance-associated genes is not available with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996699333190918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.2462158203125,
        268.8307800292969,
        385.3912353515625
      ],
      "text": "the currently recommended technology.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.2337951660156,
        462.34454345703125,
        411.3218078613281
      ],
      "text": "Antigen detection in a lateral flow format (biomarker-based detection)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.98870849609375,
        526.9644775390625,
        435.13372802734375
      ],
      "text": "The currently available lateral flow urine lipoarabinomannan assay (LF-LAM) has suboptimal",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.48870849609375,
        526.9633178710938,
        450.63372802734375
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity and specificity; thus, it is not suitable as a diagnostic test for TB in all populations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.98870849609375,
        526.947998046875,
        466.13372802734375
      ],
      "text": "However, in contrast to traditional diagnostic methods, the urine LF-LAM assay demonstrates",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.48870849609375,
        475.0212097167969,
        481.63372802734375
      ],
      "text": "improved sensitivity for the diagnosis of TB among individuals coinfected with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.46221923828125,
        441.5330505371094,
        518.8982543945312
      ],
      "text": "1.3.3 Follow-on tests for detection of TB drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.1188354492188,
        526.45458984375,
        544.206787109375
      ],
      "text": "Low-complexity automated NAATs for the detection of resistance to isoniazid and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.518798828125,
        216.75376892089844,
        558.6067504882812
      ],
      "text": "second-line anti-TB agents",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.2738037109375,
        527.15185546875,
        582.4188232421875
      ],
      "text": "The LC-aNAATs are recommended for use as a reflex test in specimens determined to be positive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.7738037109375,
        526.7674560546875,
        597.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "for   complex (MTBC); these tests offer rapid DST in intermediate and peripheral laboratories.  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946821212768555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.2738037109375,
        526.96337890625,
        613.4188232421875
      ],
      "text": "The first product in this class simultaneously detects resistance to isoniazid, fluoroquinolones,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.7738037109375,
        526.93701171875,
        628.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide and amikacin. Results are available in under 90 minutes; this is faster than with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.2738037109375,
        485.460693359375,
        644.4188232421875
      ],
      "text": "the current standard of care, which includes LPAs and culture-based phenotypic DST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.2614135742188,
        167.76853942871094,
        670.349365234375
      ],
      "text": "Line probe assays",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.0162963867188,
        526.8929443359375,
        694.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "LPAs are a family of DNA strip-based tests that can detect the MTBC DNA and determine its",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.5162963867188,
        526.9623413085938,
        709.6613159179688
      ],
      "text": "drug-resistance profile. The tests do this through the pattern of binding of amplicons (DNA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.0162963867188,
        526.7578125,
        725.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "amplification products) to probes that target specific parts of the MTBC genome; that is,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.5162963867188,
        526.743408203125,
        740.6613159179688
      ],
      "text": "common resistance-associated mutations to anti-TB drugs or the corresponding wild-type",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.0162963867188,
        526.8551635742188,
        756.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "DNA sequence  . LPAs are technically more complex to perform than the Xpert MTB/RIF  (5)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.5162963867188,
        527.1956176757812,
        771.6613159179688
      ],
      "text": "assay; however, they can detect resistance to a broader range of first-line and second-line",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        471.2744140625,
        802.0169067382812,
        552.2174072265625,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "1. Introduction 5",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}